{"book":"esther","num":7,"verses":[{"en":"So the king and Haman came to banquet with Esther the queen.","n":1,"sm":"Hamanu Ua o atu le tupu ma Hamanu e taumamafa faatasi ma le masiofo o Eseta.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Hamanu"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Hamanu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"taumamafa"},{"en":"","sm":"faatasi"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"masiofo"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Eseta."}]},{"en":"And the king said again unto Esther on the second day at the banquet of wine, What is thy petition, queen Esther? and it shall be granted thee: and what is thy request? and it shall be performed, even to the half of the kingdom.","n":2,"sm":"Ona fai atu ai lea o le tupu ia Eseta i lena aso e lua, a o fai le taumafataga o le uaina, Le masiofo e, Eseta, se a le mea e te ole mai ai? e avatua lava ia te oe; pe se a foi le mea e te faatoga mai ai? e oo lava i le vaeluaina o le malo e faia lava.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Eseta"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lena"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"lua,"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"taumafataga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"uaina,"},{"en":"","sm":"Le"},{"en":"","sm":"masiofo"},{"en":"","sm":"e,"},{"en":"","sm":"Eseta,"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"ole"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai?"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"avatua"},{"en":"","sm":"lava"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"oe;"},{"en":"","sm":"pe"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en