 palace garden: and Haman stood up to make request for his life to Esther the queen; for he saw that there was evil determined against him by the king.","n":7,"sm":"Ona tulai lea o le tupu nai le taumafataga O le uaina ua ita, ua alu ile fanua o le maota. Ona tulai lea o Hamanu e aioi i le masiofo o Eseta, la faaolaina o ia; aua ua la iloa ua tonu i le tupu e faaoo ia te la se leaga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tulai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"nai"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"taumafataga"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"uaina"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ita,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"alu"},{"en":"","sm":"ile"},{"en":"","sm":"fanua"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"maota."},{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tulai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Hamanu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"aioi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"masiofo"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Eseta,"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"faaolaina"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia;"},{"en":"","sm":"aua"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"tonu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"faaoo"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"la"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"leaga."}]},{"en":"Then the king returned out of the palace garden into the place of the banquet of wine; and Haman was fallen upon the bed whereon Esther was. Then said the king, Will he force the queen also before me in the house? As the word went out of the king's mouth, they covered Haman's face.","n":8,"sm":"Ua foi atu le tupu mai le fanua o le maota i le fale na fai ai le taumafataga o le uaina, ua paú foi Hamanu i le moega o i ai Eseta; ona fai ane lea o le tupu, Pe a toso ea foi le